{
    "title": "QR & Barcode Scanner Launcher",
    "description": "QR & Barcode Scanner & Launcher helps you read any QR code or barcode and instantly displays the content associated with it. The easy-to-use app also enhances your home screen and offers a seamless search experience with search results powered by Yahoo. \r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n\u2713 One-swipe access\r\n\u2713 QR code scanner\r\n\u2713 Barcode scanner\r\n\u2713 Scan history\r\n\u2713 Auto-copy\r\n\u2713 Multiple access points to search on Yahoo\r\n\u2713 Vibrate or beep notifications\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude80 One-swipe access: Gain quick access to QR & Barcode Scanner & Launcher's features with one swipe from your home screen. No more digging through your app list; your QR and barcode reader is just a swipe away.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf7 QR code scanner: Effortlessly scan QR codes with your smartphone\u2019s built-in camera. Just point your device's camera at the QR code, and our app will instantly decode it. Access Wi-Fi credentials, event invitations, contact details, coupons, and more. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\uded2 Barcode scanner: Our latest feature makes shopping a breeze. Scan barcodes and shop  via web results or directly on an e-commerce platform.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcda Scan history: Keep track of your scanning history with ease. Our app stores all your previously scanned QR codes and barcodes in one place, making it easy to access important links or information whenever you need.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udccb Auto-copy to clipboard: Say goodbye to the hassle of manually copying links or text from barcodes or QR codes. QR & Barcode Scanner & Launcher automatically copies the scanned content to your clipboard, allowing you to paste it wherever you want.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0a Vibration or beep notifications: Get instantly notified through vibration or a beep, confirming the code is scanned correctly. Choose your preferred notification style so you never miss a successful scan.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Multi-touchpoint search with search results powered by Yahoo: Finding what you need has never been easier. Enjoy an enhanced search experience with access to Yahoo web search via multiple access points. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe0 Home screen shortcut: Use the shortcut on your home screen for instant access to QR & Barcode Scanner & Launcher. Just tap the icon, scan a QR code or barcode, and easily access the information embedded in it. \r\n\r\nPlease write to us should you have any queries or comments about the app, including recommendations for new features. Also, please note that you can uninstall it at any time.\r\n\r\nYou give your consent to install QR & Barcode Scanner & Launcher from the Google Play\u2122 Store by clicking the button above. You also agree to this app's Terms and Conditions & Privacy Policy.\r\n\r\nGoogle Play is a trademark of Google LLC. Use of it here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by Google LLC.\r\n\r\nExplore our FAQ section to find helpful information: https://qrscanner.com/#faq\r\nFor questions or feedback, reach out to us through our contact form: https://qrscanner.com/contact-us\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy - https://qrscanner.com/atom/qrcodescanner/terms/privacypolicy.html \r\nTerms of Service - https://qrscanner.com/atom/qrcodescanner/terms/termsofservice.html",
