s powered by Yahoo: Finding what you need has never been easier. Enjoy an enhanced search experience with access to Yahoo web search via multiple access points. <br><br>\ud83c\udfe0 Home screen shortcut: Use the shortcut on your home screen for instant access to QR &amp; Barcode Scanner &amp; Launcher. Just tap the icon, scan a QR code or barcode, and easily access the information embedded in it. <br><br>Please write to us should you have any queries or comments about the app, including recommendations for new features. Also, please note that you can uninstall it at any time.<br><br>You give your consent to install QR &amp; Barcode Scanner &amp; Launcher from the Google Play\u2122 Store by clicking the button above. You also agree to this app&#39;s Terms and Conditions &amp; Privacy Policy.<br><br>Google Play is a trademark of Google LLC. Use of it here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by Google LLC.<br><br>Explore our FAQ section to find helpful information: https://qrscanner.com/#faq<br>For questions or feedback, reach out to us through our contact form: https://qrscanner.com/contact-us<br><br>Privacy Policy - https://qrscanner.com/atom/qrcodescanner/terms/privacypolicy.html <br>Terms of Service - https://qrscanner.com/atom/qrcodescanner/terms/termsofservice.html",
